oe=6AC8E5D7"}, {"file_name": "5A.png", "id": "821151567709645", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_821151571042978_6234089121180248947_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=60aMfnFXYEwQ7kNvwFmryDD&_nc_oc=AdoNzDBMBrXH37Dov87AUblNNxPBgh_poN8dSMAKBe_NzmuBuek_aZo7SEHrKHKp9Gw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMdzYy37ceD0AcPp2vVv3kpLIpLzFNg_EYU-NuvP_DzZg&oe=6AC9098E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1410369324626485", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824741_1410369327959818_5057080874294011664_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EdVcADj7Z40Q7kNvwESwZ-Q&_nc_oc=AdpW2UmLvgAwTZ2RsLCrJe-CF_W3JxR9mdeM8RKeANLC38N--vfbT3wyAp_mlDx6LZI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNf8vb5wfQ3h6edGokB3IGLL3-HNmGOq3Ndv1IHC_EXqg&oe=6AC8F360"}, "display_name": "Calmness", "keywords": ["antistress", "minimalizm", "relax", "holiday", "calmness"], "long_description": "Your Sanctuary, Your Rules\nWhy settle for one way to relax when you can explore dozens? Calmness offers a diverse collection of \"Living Rooms\"\u2014interactive environments designed to trigger an immediate relaxation response.Why Play Calmness?\nWe built this for the overthinkers, the late-night workers, and anyone who needs a five-minute escape from reality. It\u2019s the perfect companion for meditation, study, or winding down before sleep.\nUnlock the door. Leave the stress behind.", "short_description": "The world is loud, fast, and often overwhelming. Calmness is the mute button you\u2019ve been looking for.\nIn this immersive antistress experience, you aren't just playing a game\u2014you are curating your own sanctuary. Whether you need the rhythmic patter of rain against a window or the soft hum of a futuristic library, the key to your peace is literally in your hands."}]}, "developer_name": "Azai Gaming", "developer_privacy_p